Music notice

The background tracks bundled in /Songs were generated with Suno
(https://suno.com) under a Pro subscription. They are included here for use
within this project under the terms Suno grants Pro-tier subscribers for
generated output. Suno's terms of service — not this repository's CC
BY-NC-SA license — govern what you may do with those audio files
specifically; the CC BY-NC-SA license above covers this project's own code,
art, and design, not the third-party-generated audio. If you fork or reuse
this project, check Suno's current terms (https://suno.com/terms) before
redistributing or relying on the tracks in /Songs, and swap in your own
audio if you're not covered by an equivalent subscription — the game runs
fine without them (see Settings → Sound & settings).
